            IN    MAX
FIB_START:  OUT   A
            LOAD  B
            STORE TEMP
            ADD   A
            STORE B

            LOAD  TEMP
            STORE A

            COMP  MAX
            JMPLT FIB_END

            JMP   FIB_START

FIB_END:    HALT

MAX:   .DATA 0
TEMP:  .DATA 0
A:     .DATA 0
B:     .DATA 1